                                                "sense_id": "ca8d95aa-1279-3db8-ac0e-b013e76deb96",
                                                "text": "Thankfully the tension dissipates when the waitress returns to ask about dessert. He opts for a Paris-Brest, and I go for a lemon vodka sorbet."
